[statement]
A name decided before a carried name, because its one candidate needs it,
has the names that would require it decided first in turn, through the
names that candidate provides: `dep` is carried, `x1` is decided before
it, for `px`, and before `x1`, `w`, whose one candidate `kw` needs `x3`,
which `px` provides too. `kw` answers `v`, so `gk` is not installed. The
rule of `reduced/kmail-takes-kwallet-alone`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v w x1

P:kw
V:1
D:x3
p:v w=1

P:px
V:1
D:dep
p:x3=1 x1=1

P:dep
V:1

P:gk
V:1
k:100
p:v

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install dep 1
install px 1
install kw 1
install app 1
